NUM-40: apply the monthly rainfall adjustment of the month each record falls in

convertRainfall() multiplied every rain record by Adjust.rainFactor, the
factor of the month that is current when the record is read. Records are read
ahead: the first one at start-up, before climate_setState() has set any month
(factor 1.0), and each later one as soon as the record before it becomes
current, which can be in an earlier month. Pass the record's own date to
convertRainfall() and use Adjust.rain[] of that month instead.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply NUM-40_swmm530.patch

